scription":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3024780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/1-3.gif?t=1745806014\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tYou've inherited the family cleaning business, and now it\u2019s your turn to carry the vacuum and the mission. Take on cleaning jobs in a variety of unique locations, from cozy homes and messy art galleries to space stations and sunny beaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/2-3.gif?t=1745806014\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tScrub dirt, wash stains, and bring order to chaos using sponges, vacuums, steam cleaners, and the all-new pressure washer. Complete jobs to earn money and unlock new tools to expand your cleaning arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/3-1.gif?t=1745806014\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tCustomize your gear with different gloves, trash cans, and more. Whether you prefer a sleek and clean look or a colorful mess, make the job yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/4-2.gif?t=1745806014\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tNo rush, no stress \u2014 just you, your tools, and a mess to turn into perfection. Play at your own pace and enjoy the oddly satisfying joy of cleaning. And if you\u2019re feeling competitive, try to top the leaderboard by finishing jobs with maximum efficiency.</p>","developers":["Smallroom"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"des